  "solution": "Xét đồ thị hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là một parabol có đỉnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>25</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math><br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có bảng biến thiên\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/9